# === SUPABASE (WAJIB — data real kalender/approval/create) ===
# 1. Buat project di https://supabase.com → Project Settings → API
# 2. Paste ke .env.local (bukan .env.example), lalu restart `npm run dev`
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
# 3. Di Supabase SQL Editor jalankan: supabase/schema.sql lalu supabase/seed.sql
# 4. Cek koneksi: buka /api/health → supabase.connected harus true

# === GEMINI (WAJIB untuk caption + foto AI real) ===
# Ambil key di https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Caption: gemini-3.6-flash — source/model ditampilkan di UI
# Foto: gemini-3.1-flash-image (cadangan 3-pro/2.5) — hasil disimpan di Supabase Storage
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key

# CATATAN: Dashboard BOLEH dummy. Kalender/Approval/Create HARUS real (Supabase + Gemini).
